WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.098
Lucy laughed.

2
00:00:04.099 --> 00:00:08.088
"Tiny is afraid of a bug!"

3
00:00:08.089 --> 00:00:12.804
"It's just a gem fly," Bot said.

4
00:00:12.805 --> 00:00:17.277
"Gem flies won't hurt you," PJ said.

5
00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:21.232
Ringo frowned. "I'm not afraid.

6
00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:27.153
I was just . . . surprised."

7
00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:29.875
"Come on," Lucy said.

8
00:00:29.876 --> 00:00:37.486
"We need to save those miners."

9
00:00:37.487 --> 00:00:44.675
Everyone went down the tunnel.

10
00:00:44.676 --> 00:00:47.546
More gem flies flew by.

11
00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:53.809
Ringo took a deep breath.

12
00:00:53.810 --> 00:01:02.142
"Don't be afraid," Ringo whispered to himself.

13
00:01:02.143 --> 00:01:06.897
Soon the gem flies didn't scare him anymore.

14
00:01:06.898 --> 00:01:10.600
"Bot and PJ, you're right," Ringo said.

15
00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:13.755
"Gem flies aren't scary."

16
00:01:13.756 --> 00:01:20.746
But then something bigger flew by.

17
00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:24.071
It had fangs and big wings.

18
00:01:24.072 --> 00:01:26.173
Ringo shook with fear.

19
00:01:26.174 --> 00:01:29.577
"A space bat!" he thought.

20
00:01:29.578 --> 00:01:34.052
Ringo took a deep breath.

21
00:01:34.053 --> 00:01:39.735
"Don't scream," he whispered to himself.

22
00:01:39.736 --> 00:01:42.409
"If you do, Lucy will—"

23
00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:53.436
"Ahh! Space bat!" Lucy ran back up the tunnel.

24
00:01:53.437 --> 00:01:58.442
Ringo gasped. "Lucy is afraid?"

25
00:01:58.443 --> 00:02:03.191
"Space bats aren't scary," Bot said.

26
00:02:03.192 --> 00:02:06.797
"They won't hurt you," PJ said.

27
00:02:06.798 --> 00:02:10.891
Ringo nodded. "I'm not afraid."

28
00:02:10.892 --> 00:02:15.336
Suddenly a space bat hit Ringo's helmet.

29
00:02:15.337 --> 00:02:20.936
"Ahh!" Ringo ran back up the tunnel.

